{"seq":2,"slug":"sampling-plan-and-representativeness","title":"抽样方案设计与样品代表性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/thirdparty-test-lab-compliance/lab-accreditation-sampling/sampling-plan-and-representativeness","wordCount":3278,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"抽样方案设计与样品代表性\">抽样方案设计与样品代表性</h1><p>同一款儿童玩具，两份 EN 71-3 报告的格式、方法编号、限值引用可以完全一致，但其中一份抽的是仓库里待发的整批大货，另一份抽的是业务员拎进实验室的三只样品——两页纸在平台审核或海关争议中的证据力差了几个量级。抽样不是检测前的准备动作，它是&quot;批（lot）&quot;与&quot;结论&quot;之间唯一可辩护的映射链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>抽样的目标是让实验室手上的那几十克或几百件，能够代表你没有全部测的那个整体。ISO 3534-2《统计学词汇与符号——第 2 部分：应用统计》把这条链拆成可定义的环节：**抽样单元（sampling unit）**是构成批的个体或一份物料，<strong>样本</strong>是抽取出来的单元集合，<strong>实验室样品</strong>是送到实验室用于检测的那一份，**试样（test portion）**是真正进入仪器的那一小块。每一级转换都可能引入偏差，而偏差不会在报告上显示出来。代表性由五个必须同时成立的维度构成：<strong>同一性</strong>（所抽对象确为该批）、<strong>均匀性</strong>、<strong>时间性</strong>（覆盖批次漂移）、<strong>空间性</strong>（多箱多层）、<strong>可追溯性</strong>（封样与拆封记录完整）。任一维塌陷，另外四维做得再好也救不回来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[批 Lot] --&gt; B[抽样单元&lt;br/&gt;件/箱/层/份]&#10;    B --&gt; C[增量 Increment]&#10;    C --&gt; D[总样 Gross sample]&#10;    D --&gt; E[缩分 Reduction]&#10;    E --&gt; F[实验室样品&lt;br/&gt;封样送检]&#10;    F --&gt; G[试样 Test portion]&#10;    G --&gt; H[检测结果与判定]&#10;    B --&gt; I{谁执行抽样}&#10;    I --&gt;|实验室抽样| J[报告载明抽样方案]&#10;    I --&gt;|申请方送样| K[须声明结果仅适用于收到的样品]\">graph TD\n    A[批 Lot] --&gt; B[抽样单元&lt;br/&gt;件/箱/层/份]\n    B --&gt; C[增量 Increment]\n    C --&gt; D[总样 Gross sample]\n    D --&gt; E[缩分 Reduction]\n    E --&gt; F[实验室样品&lt;br/&gt;封样送检]\n    F --&gt; G[试样 Test portion]\n    G --&gt; H[检测结果与判定]\n    B --&gt; I{谁执行抽样}\n    I --&gt;|实验室抽样| J[报告载明抽样方案]\n    I --&gt;|申请方送样| K[须声明结果仅适用于收到的样品]</pre><p>相应地，一个安静的反模式是<strong>长期停留在减量检验</strong>——转移规则允许在质量稳定时降样本量，但把它当成常态，等于用更弱的判别力去覆盖一个正在漂移的过程。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>适用对象</th>\n<th>判定依据</th>\n<th>典型标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计数抽样（attributes）</td>\n<td>可数件商品，合格/不合格二分</td>\n<td>不合格品数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 与允收数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>ISO 2859-1 / GB/T 2828.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计量抽样（variables）</td>\n<td>可连续取值的特性（厚度、强度、含量）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 构造的统计量</td>\n<td>ISO 3951-1 / GB/T 6378</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>材料/均质材料取样</td>\n<td>散装物料、涂层、塑料件等无独立单元的物料</td>\n<td>逐材质、逐部位分项结果</td>\n<td>GB/T 6678 系列、EN 71-3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"计数抽样-aql-oc-曲线与两类风险\">计数抽样：AQL、OC 曲线与两类风险</h2><p>&quot;抽 125 只、允收 7 只&quot;在玩具、纺织、小家电的出货检验里不是经验之谈，而是 ISO 2859-1 主表的一次查表结果。ISO 2859-1:1999《按属性检验的抽样程序——第 1 部分：按接收质量限（AQL）检索的逐批检验抽样方案》定义了整套索引方式（中国等同标准为 GB/T 2828.1-2012，美系血统上溯 MIL-STD-105E，现由 ANSI/ASQ Z1.4 承接）。<strong>AQL（接收质量限）<strong>是被认为可接受的最差过程平均质量水平，不是&quot;允许的不良率&quot;，而是抽样方案的索引坐标；标准配套</strong>生产者风险</strong>通常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span>，<strong>消费者风险</strong>侧按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta = 10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span> 约定<strong>极限质量 LQ</strong>。</p>\n<p>方案的核心是抽检特性曲线（OC 曲线）：给定真实不合格品率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、允收数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，接收概率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>c</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_a(p) = \\sum_{d=0}^{c} \\binom{n}{d} p^{d}(1-p)^{\\,n-d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n/N \\le 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span> 时二项近似误差可忽略（反之以超几何分布）。曲线越陡判别力越强；ISO 2859-1 方案的<strong>操作比</strong>（LQ/AQL）大致落在 7 到 10 之间。查表分两步：先由批量与检验水平定<strong>样本量代码字母</strong>，再由代码字母与 AQL 定样本量与允收/拒收数。水平 I、II、III 决定松紧，特殊水平 S-1 至 S-4 用于破坏性检验；以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span>（代码字母 L，对应批量 3201–10000 的水平 II）为例，AQL 2.5 对应允收数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac=10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>、4.0 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac=14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span>（来源：ISO 2859-1 Table 2-A 正常检验一次抽样方案）。</p>\n<p>出货检验按缺陷严重度分级配 AQL：致命缺陷（涉及人身安全）取 AQL 0 或 0.10，主要缺陷取 2.5，次要缺陷取 4.0。ISO 2859-1 还规定了<strong>转移规则</strong>：连续 5 批中有 2 批被拒收时从正常检验转入<strong>加严检验</strong>，加严下连续 5 批被接收才回到正常；满足转移得分条件可转入<strong>减量检验</strong>，一旦出现不合格即退回正常。转移规则是这套体系真正起作用的部分——固定用一个方案连续验收，等于放弃了它对过程漂移的监测能力。注意 AQL 体系回答的是&quot;验收一批&quot;；若目标是<strong>估计不合格率</strong>，样本量应改由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = z^{2}p(1-p)/e^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计量抽样-用测量值换样本量\">计量抽样：用测量值换样本量</h2><p>同样要把&quot;该批不合格率超过 2%&quot;的风险压到可接受水平，计数抽样可能要从 200 只里数出 10 只坏才判拒收；若受检特性是能连续取值的量——壁厚、抗拉强度、迁移量——ISO 3951-1《按计量检验的抽样程序》往往只需十几只，因为测量值携带了比&quot;合格/不合格&quot;更多的信息。单侧上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 的标准差法判据为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>⇒</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{x} + k\\,s \\le U \\Rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span></span></span></span></span> 接收，下限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 则判 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{x} - k s \\ge L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>；接收常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 按样本量与 AQL 从 ISO 3951 表中查得。</p>\n<p>代价写在假设里：<strong>判据的有效性依赖特性服从正态分布</strong>。来料是双峰分布（两个供应商混批）、明显右偏或含离群值时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 法给出的接收概率会严重偏离标称值。工程做法是先做正态性检验（Shapiro-Wilk 或偏度/峰度联合检验），不通过就退回计数抽样或先做变量变换。另一个误用是把计量方案套上<strong>非均质特性</strong>——一颗螺丝的硬度若批内差异来自热处理炉位而非随机波动，正态假设本身就不成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"散装物料与均质材料取样\">散装物料与均质材料取样</h2><p>对着一整柜 PVC 粒料说&quot;抽 200 个&quot;没有意义，因为不存在 200 个独立单元。散装物料走另一套逻辑：先在多个点位抽取<strong>增量（increment）</strong>，汇成<strong>总样（gross sample）</strong>，再经<strong>缩分</strong>得到实验室样品。GB/T 6678-2003《化工产品采样总则》及 GB/T 6679（固体）、GB/T 6680（液体）规定点位分布、增量数量与缩分方法；缩分常用四分法或分样器（riffle splitter），目的是在不改变物料组成的前提下把体积降下来。</p>\n<p>化学限量合规的主战场在**均质材料（homogeneous material）**层面。EN 71-3:2019+A1:2021 要求把玩具样品拆解成均质材料分别制样，用 0.07 mol/L 盐酸在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>37</mn><mo>±</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">37 \\pm 2\\,°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 下迁移 1 至 2 小时（按材料类别）再以 ICP-MS 定量。美国侧，CPSIA 把铅拆成两套口径：基材按总铅 100 ppm、表面涂层按 90 ppm 分别判定（15 U.S.C. 2063），邻苯二甲酸酯按 16 CFR Part 1307 对 8 种物质各限 0.1%。这意味着&quot;一件玩具&quot;在取样层面会被拆成十几个甚至几十个样品，每个对应一个独立的符合性结论。高频事故由此而生：<strong>复合样平均化掩盖热点</strong>——把多个部位合并成一个样做一次检测，看似省成本，实则把某处含铅焊点的读数摊薄到检出限以下；散装粉料只取表层也同理，因为偏析会让密度不同的组分富集在特定层位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抽样记录与报告声明-iso-iec-17025\">抽样记录与报告声明（ISO/IEC 17025）</h2><p>ISO/IEC 17025:2017 第 7.3 条专门规定抽样：实验室若承担抽样，必须有<strong>抽样计划（sampling plan）<strong>和</strong>抽样方法</strong>，两者都应基于适当的统计方法并以文件形式保持，且须记录抽样数据（日期、时间、地点、抽样人、环境条件等），任何偏离抽样计划的细节都应随结果一并报告。抽样不是&quot;检测前的手续&quot;，它是被认可范围覆盖、需要方法验证的活动。第 7.8 条则规定：实验室执行了抽样时，报告须载明抽样方案的全部必要信息；当<strong>样品由客户提供、实验室未执行抽样</strong>时，报告必须声明&quot;结果仅适用于收到的样品&quot;——这条声明在平台争议里常被用来证明&quot;这份报告证明不了大货&quot;。判定规则同样属于抽样合规：ILAC-G8:09/2019《判定规则与符合性声明指南》要求实验室对限值下符合性结论时声明所用判定规则；结合第 7.6 条的测量不确定度要求，常见的三种处理——不考虑不确定度的简单接收、以保护带（如取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w = 0.5U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>）收紧限值、或与客户约定共担风险——会改变同一个读数的判定结果。报告只写&quot;结论：合格&quot;而不写判定规则，在监管问询中经不起追问。抽样环节必须留存的记录及其缺失后果如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>记录项</th>\n<th>为什么必须留</th>\n<th>缺失后的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>抽样方案编号与标准（如 ISO 2859-1 水平 II、AQL 2.5）</td>\n<td>使结论可被独立重算</td>\n<td>无法证明抽检保护水平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抽样人与机构、时间地点（仓库/产线/柜号）</td>\n<td>区分实验室抽样与客户送样，锚定具体批</td>\n<td>报告仅能声明&quot;适用于收到样品&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量、样本量、允收/拒收数</td>\n<td>支撑判定</td>\n<td>结论不可复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>封样方式与拆封记录、影像</td>\n<td>证明样品未被替换</td>\n<td>面对&quot;金样&quot;质疑无法自证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代表性失效与平台监管采信\">代表性失效与平台监管采信</h2><p>最常见的抽样事故不是方法算错，而是<strong>抽样对象根本不是即将交付的那批货</strong>：申请方自送、挑选外观最好的样品（业内俗称&quot;金样&quot;）送检，报告合格、大货不合规。ISO/IEC 17025 的&quot;未由实验室抽样&quot;声明正是为这种情形准备的免责条款；平台和监管机构一旦看到该声明，对报告的采信度会显著下降。</p>\n<p>平台侧的做法近年持续收紧：多家跨境平台在玩具、儿童用品、电子电器等高风险类目上，要求提交由 ISO/IEC 17025 认可实验室出具、且以<strong>代表性样品</strong>为基础的检测报告，并对报告时效设有窗口（常见口径为出具后 12 个月内），报告与在售实物明显不符时要求复检或由平台指定实验室重测。可采信度取决于抽样环节能否被独立复现，而非实验室名气。</p>\n<p>监管侧同样把抽样当作执法支点。美国 CPSC 依 16 CFR Part 1107 要求儿童产品证书所依据的<strong>周期性测试</strong>必须基于代表性样品，且由 CPSC 认可的第三方实验室完成；2024 年 12 月 CPSC 修订 16 CFR Part 1110 的最终规则引入证书数据电子申报（eFiling），自 2026 年 7 月 28 日起全面执行。欧盟侧，Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 赋予市场监管机构现场检查、取样与要求提供技术文件的权力；通用产品安全法规 (EU) 2023/988（GPSR）自 2024 年 12 月 13 日起适用。这些机制的共同前提是：抽样对象可被定位到具体批、具体柜、具体申报单。</p>\n<p>抽样方案的设计通常还要与最终报告的签发口径对齐——报告上如何声明抽样方、认可标识在什么范围内可用，属于认可体系的问题，见同章的《实验室资质体系：CNAS/CMA/ILAC-MRA 与 ISO 17025》。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>抽样是&quot;批&quot;与&quot;结论&quot;之间唯一可辩护的映射链，单元→样本→实验室样品→试样的每一级转换都可能引入报告上看不见的偏差（ISO 3534-2）。</li>\n<li>代表性由同一性、均匀性、时间性、空间性、可追溯性五个维度共同构成，任一维塌陷即整体失效。</li>\n<li>计数抽样以 ISO 2859-1（GB/T 2828.1）为通用语言：批量与检验水平定代码字母，代码字母与 AQL 定样本量与允收数，行业默认主要缺陷 AQL 2.5、次要缺陷 4.0、致命缺陷取 0；转移规则是体系真正起作用的部分。</li>\n<li>计量抽样（ISO 3951）在同保护水平下样本量更小，代价是正态分布假设。</li>\n<li>散装物料与均质材料取样走 GB/T 6678 系列的逻辑，复合样平均化会掩盖热点。</li>\n<li>ISO/IEC 17025:2017 第 7.3、7.8 条把抽样变成被认可覆盖的活动：客户送样时报告须声明&quot;结果仅适用于收到的样品&quot;。</li>\n<li>平台与监管（CPSC 16 CFR 1107/1110、EU 2019/1020、GPSR）都把抽样对象能否定位到具体批作为采信前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"抽样方案设计与样品代表性","id":"抽样方案设计与样品代表性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"计数抽样：AQL、OC 曲线与两类风险","id":"计数抽样-aql-oc-曲线与两类风险"},{"level":2,"text":"计量抽样：用测量值换样本量","id":"计量抽样-用测量值换样本量"},{"level":2,"text":"散装物料与均质材料取样","id":"散装物料与均质材料取样"},{"level":2,"text":"抽样记录与报告声明（ISO/IEC 17025）","id":"抽样记录与报告声明-iso-iec-17025"},{"level":2,"text":"代表性失效与平台监管采信","id":"代表性失效与平台监管采信"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实验室资质体系：CNAS/CMA/ILAC-MRA 与 ISO 17025","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/thirdparty-test-lab-compliance/lab-accreditation-sampling/lab-accreditation-framework"},"next":{"title":"实验室准入审核与检测数据造假风控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/thirdparty-test-lab-compliance/lab-accreditation-sampling/lab-onboarding-audit-and-anti-fraud"}}